# ledger_demo

cast WREN
  .label "Wren"

-- intro

WREN
  Welcome to Saltmere.

-- meeting

after not played(intro)
  WREN
    Wait -- have we met?

after played(intro)
  WREN
    Back already.

WREN
  Pick one.

  * Yes, returning.
    -> ending
  * No, first time.
    WREN
      That's right -- you came in from the road.
    -> ending

-- ending if visits(meeting) >= 1

WREN
  Safe travels.
